Package: hyu-vpn
Version: 0.2.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: IRCVLab <noreply@github.com>
Depends: vpnc-scripts, libgnutls30, libxml2 (>= 2.9), libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.6), libglib2.0-0, dbus-user-session
Description: Reliable HYU VPN tray application
 HYU VPN stores credentials locally in encrypted form, reconnects after
 network changes and VPN session expiry, and provides a native Ubuntu tray UI.
